     {
      "text": "Zaphnath-paaneah -- Asenath, the Gentile bride espoused by Joseph the rejected one John 19:15 type of the Church, called out from the Gentiles to be the bride of Christ during the time of His rejection by His brethren, Israel.; Acts 15:14; Ephesians 5:31,32. (See Scofield \"Genesis 37:2\").\n\nZaphnath-paaneah -- Coptic, revealer of secret things."
     }
